<div class="cont js-cont-wrap">
    <div class="cont01 js-cont">
        <p class="img"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont01_img.png" alt=""></p>
    </div>
    <div class="cont02 js-cont">
        <h3 class="mb120" data-aos="fade-down"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_tit.png" alt=""></h3>
        <p class="mb40"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_txt.png" alt=""></p>
        <div class="inner">
            <div class="infra-wrap">
                <div class="box"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_img01.jpg" alt=""></div> 
                <div class="box ml20">
                    <div class="infra-slide swiper-container">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide01.jpg" alt=""></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide02.jpg" alt=""></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide03.jpg" alt=""></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide04.jpg" alt=""></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide05.jpg" alt=""></div>
                            <div class="swiper-slide"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide06.jpg" alt=""></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-pagination infra"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide_txt01.jpg" alt=""></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="mb40"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_txt02.png" alt=""></p>
            <div class="infra-wrap">
                <div class="box">
                    <img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_img02.jpg" alt="">
                    <p class="r-txt">** 22-24 년 러셀 기숙전체 중 HS 반 인원 추이 (22년 142명 , 23년 169명 , 24년 188명)</p>
                </div> 
                <div class="box d-start ml20">
                    <ul>
                        <li class="doughnut">
                            <p>재수생 우선선발반 재원생<br>
                                <span>10명 중 9명</span> 수능 성적 향상<br>
                                <span class="txt">*HS반, 서의치반, 연고대반 재원생 기준</span>
                            </p>
                            <div class="chart-area">
                                <canvas id="doughnut-chart" width="171px" width="171px"></canvas>
                                <div class="chart-img"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_img03.png" alt="" /></div>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <div><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_img04.png" alt="" /></div>
                            <span class="bubble"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_bubble.png" alt="" /></span>
                            <span class="arrow02"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/ico_arrow.png" alt="" /></span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="r-txt" style="right: 33px;">* 2023년 러셀학원 내 HS반,연고대반 재원생들의 메가X대성 더 프리미엄 모의고사 국수영탐2 평균성적 비교</p>
                    <p class="mt0"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont02_slide_txt03.jpg" alt=""></p>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cont03 js-cont">
        <h3 data-aos="fade-down"><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont03_tit.png" alt=""></h3>
        <p><img src="<%=img_path_russelhs %>/event/2024/cont03_img.png" alt=""></p>
    </div>
</div>